{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["באל שדי — a promise about the future, and I have not yet fulfilled it." "ושמי ה׳ — this is how it must be explained: I appeared to them באל שדי. And my essential name is ה׳. And this is a duplication of expression." "לא נודעתי להם — I did not become known to them by the essential name, but rather — באל שדי; but to you I have revealed the essence of my name, the memorial name ה׳. And in your days I will fulfill my promise to give them the land of Canaan. And 'my name' is in construct state with what precedes, as I explained. Now had it been written לא הודעתי להם, then 'ושמי ה׳ לא הודעתי' would be the parsing."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:40:30.922565327Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}